# Build context for services/analyzer/Dockerfile (built with the REPO ROOT as context so the
# image can carry packages/schema/schemas — the same files the TypeScript types are generated
# from, never a copy). Allowlist style: exclude everything, re-include only what the image
# needs, then strip the heavy machine-local pieces back out.
*
!services/analyzer
services/analyzer/.venv
services/analyzer/out
services/analyzer/out-baseline
services/analyzer/runs
services/analyzer/models
services/analyzer/datasets
!packages/schema/schemas
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pt
**/*.onnx
**/*.task
**/*.mp4
